WEBVTT

00:01:55.962 --> 00:02:00.609
about how AI could actually enhance
the future of human work.

00:02:00.633 --> 00:02:03.720
I found this to be
such a fascinating conversation,

00:02:03.744 --> 00:02:06.402
alarming and thrilling in equal measure.

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:08.080
Let's do it.

00:02:09.639 --> 00:02:10.990
Kai-Fu Lee, welcome.

00:02:11.014 --> 00:02:12.823
KFL: Thank you, great to be here.

00:02:12.847 --> 00:02:15.824
CA: So I'm so excited
for this conversation,

00:02:15.848 --> 00:02:20.004
we get to dive into what you consider,
I think what I consider,

00:02:20.028 --> 00:02:22.188
to be really one
of the most important topics,

00:02:22.212 --> 00:02:25.742
perhaps the most important topic
facing humanity's future:

00:02:25.766 --> 00:02:28.520
artificial intelligence, AI,

00:02:28.544 --> 00:02:32.114
and where it will take us,
and how excited we should be about it,